  "releaseNotes": "Refresh the MAUI shell experience: semantic fields, feedback and design tokens, native icon actions with reduced-motion support, a separate My Tasks panel beside a searchable virtual module catalogue with device pins, and accessible login, account and approval layouts. Fix navigation loading, approval connection recovery, text editing in fields, a crash in Home drag buttons, and the caller identity sent after simulated sign-in.\n\nFull release note: https://github.com/MatrixCode-ID/em-system/blob/v0.1.0-alpha.19/doc/ReleaseNote/EmSys.Ui.Maui.Core/0.1.0-alpha.19.md",
